MODULE downloader

FUNCTION obtain package asset
    validate checksum, size, and HTTPS URL
    locate the digest-named cache object
    if its size and checksum are valid, return it
    otherwise preserve an existing invalid cache object in local trash
    if offline mode is active, report the missing verified object
    otherwise download it

FUNCTION download asset
    request the identity representation with the configured client timeout and
        Portprog user agent
    reject redirect loops, embedded credentials, and any redirect away from HTTPS
    require HTTP 200
    reject declared or streamed data over the configured byte limit
    stream into a temporary cache file while computing SHA-256
    synchronize and close all streams
    require the optional publisher size and required checksum
    set safe permissions and atomically publish to the digest path
    preserve failed temporary data in local trash when possible

FUNCTION verify cached file
    require a regular file, optional exact size, and exact SHA-256
